  "description": "The Second Life wire protocol for LibreMetaverse, without the client: the UDP packet classes generated from the message template, the packet decoder, the capability event-queue messages, and the enums they use. Pulled in by the LibreMetaverse package; reference it alone to build packet tools such as proxies and capture analysers.",
